受支持的 Android 设备上阻止 AI 助手读取 Signal 会话内容，防止内置的 Siri 与 Gemini 在代办任务时抓取私密对话。",{"_56":337,"_325":323},"2026-11-22T15:15:25.000Z","BleepingComputer","vhwsrs0gjyf9ww19y405j8l1j","Signal 限制 iOS 27 与 Android 上的 OS 级 AI Agent 读取屏幕","Signal 在 iOS 27 和 Android 上阻止 OS 级 AI Agent 读取其应用屏幕，防范 Gemini Intelligence 与 Siri AI 等功能捕获消息，macOS 暂未提供同等保护。",{"_56":343,"_325":323},"2026-11-22T18:01:22.000Z","Security Affairs","x6j5h5pztga617tj7c899gbhw","Signal 阻止 iOS 27 与 Android AI 助手读取私人消息","Signal 限制 iOS 27 上的 Siri AI 及受支持 Android 设备上的 AI 助手读取聊天内容，以阻止消息文本被捕获并写入本地数据库或远程服务器。",{"_56":349,"_325":323},"2026-11-23T08:53:49.000Z","Help Net Security","txpl9wsdxvqh9juyqfqq1zzl2","Signal 在 11 月 20 日的博客中宣布限制 iOS 与 Android 中内置 AI 助手读取用户聊天记录，Signal Foundation 总裁 Meredith Whittaker 称操作系统内置的 AI 助手是 Signal 面临的「生存性威胁」。",{"_56":353,"_325":323},"Infosecurity Magazine",{"_356":362,"_13":363,"_20":336,"_17":153,"_359":364},{"_356":357,"_13":358,"_20":21,"_17":208,"_359":360},"factId","famSDoGVPh44","Signal限制截图读取消息","representative",{"_315":326,"_13":327,"_28":328,"_319":361,"_321":330,"_322":323},{"_56":331,"_325":323},"fOi1JsF_SiCg","Signal 阻止 AI 助手读取聊天",{"_315":332,"_13":333,"_28":334,"_319":365,"_321":336,"_322":323},{"_56":337,"_325":323},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete",true,"rank",{"_374":375,"_376":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
